{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/6bbb3d280ef61ebda8a90202bbb288c6.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Iteranil, a world buried with\u00a0an insurmountable number of mysteries\u00a0and an ever-shifting society's struggle with co-existence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/25b37224f368ebcba019afb2ce2b91b0.poster.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/25b37224f368ebcba019afb2ce2b91b0.webm?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/25b37224f368ebcba019afb2ce2b91b0.mp4?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the region of eternal flow, the present time is stable, if not tense. Much like other regions, mysteries remain unsolved here, but the most prominent one is the Centennial Tower; A looming figure in the distant ocean that is said to be unreachable. Some say it grants great power to those who reach it, while some say those who travel towards it will become cursed, or some say it is merely an illusion. A mysterious scholar intends to tamper the truth, but his venture will be far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/c565b19347cc90be2a33818b528beaff.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The more characters that get intertwined, the more the conflict accumulates...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/ec7c0c1d4db2721c4e6dda47eda26da0.poster.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/ec7c0c1d4db2721c4e6dda47eda26da0.webm?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/ec7c0c1d4db2721c4e6dda47eda26da0.mp4?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the lens of multiple characters as you plow through foes and uncover the land of eternal flow. Fight alone or fight with a partner; Conquer the precarious land with finesse and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek allies, recruit fighters and most importantly, <strong>destroy those who impede you from your goals.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/c1d62ba7d5628a12b301dc3aab572e39.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It takes wits and skill to exploit power.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/9dd14050500f530e287732c057055d53.poster.avif?t=1773906905\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/9dd14050500f530e287732c057055d53.webm?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923720/extras/9dd14050500f530e287732c057055d53.mp4?t=1773906905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You behold this world not without power. Take control of multiple characters and pair up to become a force to be reckoned with. Immediate power awaits the observer, all it takes is the acumen to realize its potential...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique playstyles for each character</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging, fast-paced encounters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location and quest tracking</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An interconnected map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Campaigns</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game is in an early state. Things are still bound to change, mostly visuals.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stepping Stones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923720/3630c026a3a68c68df5ea047657aa78cb4d719b0.jpg"},{"name":"Conflicts Divided","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923720/8050a5bb7cf18437e979e0dedbe883289a52a747.jpg"},{"name":"Trustworthy Bar Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923720/3363a02484b2d50f0562ff477c146ef7dc0920f9.jpg"},{"name":"You're Already Dead...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923720/5c1bba3475f299fc5188fc4afd755b253183364a.jpg"},{"name":"You're Toast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923720/87218883936f1c9230f1a2d7053e7fa65b8d6561.jpg"},{"n